      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-20T11:40:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Could this be an enum?\nThis value is passed around in several places. It requires some work to change all the usages to an enum. If you think this is needed, we can do it in a separate cl.\n\n\u003e can we point at the canonical source of the valid values?\nHow to do this?",
